Z||000001||862M4inCA||01-14-2000||08:29 PM||||I have found that if I try using my "backspace" key that occasionally it will only go back one level. In that case I've had to hold the alt key and press the "&lt;-". That usually works for me. Otherwise, I'd try reinstalling if you have a backup available.<p>[This message has been edited by 862M4inCA (edited 01-14-2000).]||||reg||1
